        {
          "text": "Te eri ngulupi mu acizu etuzu o’du alu roko dria, mu ri pati wereari ma etia; eri a’i dra i dri kini, Fu dri ma dri ’dipi ’bo; Yehova la, mi ’du curu’do idri mani ra; a’disiku ma agani ma a’bipi onyisi ku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.4",
